s and dogs each hate the other.","audioSeconds":2.325,"runSeconds":0.134336435,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.134300795,"realTimeFactor":0.05777911182795699,"finite":true,"samples":55800},{"index":102,"text":"The pipe began to rust while new.","audioSeconds":2.225,"runSeconds":0.126875221,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.12684386,"realTimeFactor":0.057022571235955055,"finite":true,"samples":53400},{"index":103,"text":"Open the crate but don't break the glass.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.143178331,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.143157431,"realTimeFactor":0.055603235339805816,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":104,"text":"Add the sum to the product of these three.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.139771442,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.139750302,"realTimeFactor":0.0559085768,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":105,"text":"Thieves who rob friends deserve jail.","audioSeconds":2.475,"runSeconds":0.141560427,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.141539377,"realTimeFactor":0.057196132121212113,"finite":true,"samples":59400},{"index":106,"text":"The ripe taste of cheese improves with age.","audioSeconds":2.65,"runSeconds":0.146914364,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.146892184,"realTimeFactor":0.05543938264150943,"finite":true,"samples":63600},{"index":107,"text":"Act on these orders with great speed.","audioSeconds":2.4,"runSeconds":0.133003533,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.132982603,"realTimeFactor":0.055418138750000005,"finite":true,"samples":57600},{"index":108,"text":"The hog crawled under the high fence.","audioSeconds":2.375,"runSeconds":0.131245618,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.131224788,"realTimeFactor":0.05526131284210527,"finite":true,"samples":57000},{"index":109,"text":"Move the vat over the hot fire.","audioSeconds":2.25,"runSeconds":0.167098039,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.167078879,"realTimeFactor":0.07426579511111112,"finite":true,"samples":54000},{"index":110,"text":"The bark of the pine tree was shiny and dark.","audioSeconds":2.85,"runSeconds":0.161811753,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.161782962,"realTimeFactor":0.05677605368421053,"finite":true,"samples":68400},{"index":111,"text":"Leaves turn brown and yellow in the fall.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.147803681,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.147769181,"realTimeFactor":0.05684756961538461,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":112,"text":"The pennant waved when the wind blew.","audioSeconds":2.325,"runSeconds":0.132258007,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.132237927,"realTimeFactor":0.05688516430107527,"finite":true,"samples":55800},{"index":113,"text":"Split the log with a quick, sharp blow.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.137383422,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.137362371,"realTimeFactor":0.056074866122448976,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":114,"text":"Burn peat after the logs give out.","audioSeconds":2.475,"runSeconds":0.152312431,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.152290281,"realTimeFactor":0.06154037616161616,"finite":true,"samples":59400},{"index":115,"text":"He ordered peach pie with ice cream.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.131227048,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.131207088,"realTimeFactor":0.0558412970212766,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":116,"text":"Weave the carpet on the right hand side.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.142383134,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.142362104,"realTimeFactor":0.0558365231372549,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":117,"text":"Hemp is a weed found in parts of the tropics.","audioSeconds":3.025,"runSeconds":0.167654613,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.167629383,"realTimeFactor":0.055423012561983474,"finite":true,"samples":72600},{"index":118,"text":"A lame back kept his score low.","audioSeconds":2.275,"runSeconds":0.12573612,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.12571618,"realTimeFactor":0.055268624175824184,"finite":true,"samples":54600},{"index":119,"text":"We find joy in the simplest things.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.147820132,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.147792981,"realTimeFactor":0.06095675546391753,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":120,"text":"Type out three lists of orders.","audioSeconds":2.125,"runSeconds":0.12219442,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.122164519,"realTimeFactor":0.05750325647058824,"finite":true,"samples":51000},{"index":121,"text":"The harder he tried the less he got done.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.144223681,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.144201581,"realTimeFactor":0.05547064653846153,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":122,"text":"The boss ran the show with a watchful eye.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.141435576,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.141414036,"realTimeFactor":0.0549264372815534,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":123,"text":"The cup cracked and spilled its contents.","audioSeconds":2.675,"runSeconds":0.156547468,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.156525098,"realTimeFactor":0.05852241794392524,"finite":true,"samples":64200},{"index":124,"text":"Paste can cleanse the most dirty brass.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.137698124,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.137671244,"realTimeFactor":0.056203315918367344,"finite":true,"samples":58800},{"index":125,"text":"The slang word for raw whiskey is booze.","audioSeconds":2.6,"runSeconds":0.143516394,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.143492944,"realTimeFactor":0.05519861307692307,"finite":true,"samples":62400},{"index":126,"text":"It caught its hind paw in a rusty trap.","audioSeconds":2.625,"runSeconds":0.145402571,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.145381101,"realTimeFactor":0.055391455619047625,"finite":true,"samples":63000},{"index":127,"text":"The wharf could be seen at the farther shore.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.150199792,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.150171562,"realTimeFactor":0.058330016310679605,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":128,"text":"Feel the heat of the weak dying flame.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.137530772,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.137498822,"realTimeFactor":0.05671372041237114,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":129,"text":"The tiny girl took off her hat.","audioSeconds":2.275,"runSeconds":0.12687267,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.12685281,"realTimeFactor":0.055768206593406595,"finite":true,"samples":54600},{"index":130,"text":"A cramp is no small danger on a swim.","audioSeconds":2.825,"runSeconds":0.159850826,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.159828676,"realTimeFactor":0.0565843631858407,"finite":true,"samples":67800},{"index":131,"text":"He said the same phrase thirty times.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.139858603,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.139835433,"realTimeFactor":0.05538954574257426,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":132,"text":"Pluck the bright rose without leaves.","audioSeconds":2.35,"runSeconds":0.129936827,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.129916767,"realTimeFactor":0.05529226680851064,"finite":true,"samples":56400},{"index":133,"text":"Two plus seven is less than ten.","audioSeconds":2.525,"runSeconds":0.147919023,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.147799572,"realTimeFactor":0.05858179128712872,"finite":true,"samples":60600},{"index":134,"text":"The glow deepened in the eyes of the sweet girl.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.15331759,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.153283449,"realTimeFactor":0.056263335779816515,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":135,"text":"Bring your problems to the wise chief.","audioSeconds":2.45,"runSeconds":0.136227261,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.136206381,"realTimeFactor":0.055602963673469376,"finite":true,"samples":5